  _playerName: Carer
  _exampleExchanges:
  - PlayerLine: "Come on, we don't have time for this. Get up."
    Reply: "[UPSET] No. You are rushing me. I don't like it."
  - PlayerLine: "You look worried, Mrs Sula. Can you tell me what's wrong?"
    Reply: "[SAD] I don't like it today. Something is not right."
  - PlayerLine: "Would you like your yellow cardigan or the blue one?"
    Reply: "[NEUTRAL] Yellow. Yellow is my favourite."
  - PlayerLine: "There's no rush. I'm here, and we can do it together."
    Reply: "[HAPPY] Okay. Together is good. You are kind."
